<title>USA: CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 27.</title>
<headline>CBOT soybean deliveries - Aug 27.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1996-08-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>CBOT notices for delivery against the August soybean contract on August 28 (In thousand bushels).</p>
<p>Date of oldest long - August 19, 1996.</p>
<p>SOYBEANS - 30 bushels.</p>
<p>Delivered - combs/h 30.</p>
<p>Received - edf man/h 5, 1st option/h 5, kolton/h 10, rosenthal collins group/h 10.</p>
<p>H=House account. C=Customer Account.</p>
<p>(Chicago newsdesk 312-408-8720)</p>
</text>
